# SanntiS ref the objectives are written against (one line: <ref> <repo URL>).
# v1.0.0-beta.1 = the released 1.0 beta (EMG-10233 ingestion: MIBiG by version, MIBiG-format external data,
# --npc-cache): objectives 01/02. The release model (objective 01) was trained with this version.
# Objectives 01 and 02 (jobs 14471873 / 14487115, 2026-10-30) ran with the sanntis-1.0.0b1 build (wheel installed
# 2026-10-30 06:02 UTC, unchanged since), made just before the tag: identical to it but for licence headers and
# the --npc-cache seeding of training-data collection (absent from the build, so not used; optional in the tag).
# Objectives 00 and 05 ran on the pre-release development repository (commit 842675a, before EMG-10233);
# 05's workers/mibig_proteins.py uses the removed CollectOptions(statuses=, nuccore_root=) and needs that
# code to re-run.
# Objective 03 on the v2 test sets (2026-11-02/03, its expected/) ran with the same sanntis-1.0.0b1 build; it
# uses none of the code that differs from the tag. Its test-set scoring code (workers/sv1) is copied from
# 842675a, where it was removed before the release; its expected/v1sets/ tables are from the 842675a release run.
v1.0.0-beta.1 https://github.com/Finn-Lab/SanntiS
